@startuml
title Suborder Handling and Student Status Query — Sequence DRAFT
actor Merchant
actor Student
participant "Ordering System" as System
participant "Suborder" as Suborder
participant "Inventory" as Inventory

Merchant -> System: Open own suborders
System -> Suborder: Find suborders for merchant
Suborder --> System: Own visible suborders and states
System --> Merchant: Show own suborders

Merchant -> System: Update suborder status
System -> Suborder: Validate allowed transition and update
Suborder --> System: Updated status
System --> Merchant: Show updated status

opt Merchant rejects a pending suborder
  System -> Inventory: Restore deducted stock when applicable
  note right of Inventory
    Restoration after inventory-mode change is Unconfirmed (G3-19).
  end note
end

Student -> System: Open or refresh own order details
System -> Suborder: Read order and visible suborders
Suborder --> System: IDs, details, amounts and statuses
System --> Student: Show own order and suborders

note over Merchant,Suborder
  Requirements: FR-21, FR-26–FR-30, FR-33
  Merchant visibility and state changes are limited to own suborders.
end note
@enduml
